# 设置 on the desktop (sfdesk settings_frame.mbt, the web's cloud/settings.tsx): MBUI_WIN=1280x800 over the made-up
# chat. ⌘, then each page of the sidebar ported from the web's, a still of each: 通知, 权限, 快捷键, 版本, 归档, 自动决策,
# 记忆, Workspace, 安全, 密钥, the account; then 连接.
timeout 40000
until 按空格输入
wait 600
key cmd+,
wait 1000
tap 通知
wait 900
tap 权限
wait 900
tap 快捷键
wait 900
tap 版本
wait 900
tap 归档
wait 900
tap 自动决策
wait 900
tap 记忆
wait 900
tap Workspace
wait 900
tap 安全
wait 900
tap 密钥
wait 900
tap lin@example.com
wait 900
tap 连接
wait 900
exit
